# Email sent to the reviewer who ran a Batch Publish, summarizing the outcome.
#
# Parameters:
#   {DEPOSIT_LOCATION}: The name of the deposit location the batch was published to.
#   {TOTAL_COUNT}: The number of submissions attempted.
#   {DEPOSITED_COUNT}: The number of submissions deposited and recorded as Published.
#   {FAILED_COUNT}: The number of submissions that failed to deposit.
#   {NOT_RECORDED_COUNT}: The number of submissions deposited to the repository but not recorded in Vireo.
#   {FINISHED_AT}: The date, time, and time zone at which the batch finished.
#   {NOT_RECORDED_LIST}: One line per submission deposited but not recorded (id, title, deposit URL, and reason).
#   {DEPOSITED_LIST}: One line per deposited submission (id and title).
#   {FAILED_LIST}: One line per failed submission (id, title, and reason).
#
# If a template has no {NOT_RECORDED_LIST}, deposited but not recorded submissions are
# listed in {FAILED_LIST} and counted in {FAILED_COUNT} instead.
#
Subject: Batch Publish Summary: {DEPOSITED_COUNT} deposited, {FAILED_COUNT} failed, {NOT_RECORDED_COUNT} not recorded

Batch publish to {DEPOSIT_LOCATION} finished at {FINISHED_AT}.

Attempted: {TOTAL_COUNT}
Deposited: {DEPOSITED_COUNT}
Failed: {FAILED_COUNT}
Deposited, not recorded: {NOT_RECORDED_COUNT}

Deposited, not recorded (do not retry):
These submissions were deposited to {DEPOSIT_LOCATION}, but Vireo could not record the deposit.
Check each one in the repository and correct its Vireo record by hand. Publishing them again creates duplicates.
{NOT_RECORDED_LIST}

Failed deposits:
{FAILED_LIST}

Deposited submissions:
{DEPOSITED_LIST}

The Vireo Team
